  "note": "Captured from origin/main ee7a41b27 before the #347 orbit change; the plain (basic, non-brand) pages were recaptured for #7777 (approved basic skin with the official G mark and Chat font stack and Chat type metrics (label/button/link/foot), plus the Chat submit gap; colours stay the basic blue), while the LoveTree form markup stays frozen. state= and code_challenge= are normalised because they are random per request.",
